<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT WASHINGTON MEN'S TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on Friday at the</p>
<p>$675,000 Legg Mason Tennis Classic (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat 7-Scott Draper (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>2-Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat 8-Tommy Haas (Germany)</p>
<p>6-7 (2-7) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>11-Brett Steven (New Zealand) beat Ranier Schuttler (Germany</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>David Wheaton (U.S.) beat 14-Vince Spadea (U.S.) 6-3 4-6 6-2</p>
</text>
